 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 1.4,
   "end": 2.735,
   "text": "Hi, I'm Sierra."
  },
  {
   "start": 2.735,
   "end": 6.36,
   "text": "Here's how noncredit learning becomes college credit."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.76,
   "end": 11.451,
   "text": "Last year,"
  },
  {
   "start": 11.451,
   "end": 18.446,
   "text": "Chancellor Christian said that noncredit and not-for-credit learners would be key to our CPL goal."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.446,
   "end": 24.318,
   "text": "Our colleges have served more than fifty-two thousand students through CPL so far."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.318,
   "end": 25.527,
   "text": "By twenty thirty,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.527,
   "end": 31.054,
   "text": "CPL for about seventy-five hundred noncredit learners a year is within reach."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.854,
   "end": 37.358,
   "text": "About one in four of our students takes a noncredit course each year."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.358,
   "end": 43.712,
   "text": "Nearly thirty thousand students earned a noncredit award in twenty twenty-four to twenty-five."
  },
  {
   "start": 43.712,
   "end": 55.053,
   "text": "And noncredit students who were working before they enrolled saw their median quarterly wages rise thirty-four percent a year after finishing or leaving their program."
  },
  {
   "start": 56.853,
   "end": 63.071,
   "text": "Mira's free noncredit community health worker courses at Cabrillo College mirror credit courses."
  },
  {
   "start": 63.071,
   "end": 68.834,
   "text": "She earned eight units of credit and a Certificate of Achievement without retaking a class."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.734,
   "end": 77.789,
   "text": "Emilio earned his EMT certification through Moreno Valley College's noncredit program."
  },
  {
   "start": 77.789,
   "end": 80.98,
   "text": "The college awards eight and a half units for it,"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.98,
   "end": 87.199,
   "text": "toward a paramedic or fire technology degree and on to a bachelor's in emergency management."
  },
  {
   "start": 89.999,
   "end": 95.642,
   "text": "Carla climbed Mount San Antonio College's noncredit health ladder to the LVN license."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.642,
   "end": 102.318,
   "text": "College of the Desert awards twenty-two units for that license toward an associate degree in nursing,"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.318,
   "end": 106.531,
   "text": "and Mount San Antonio College is documenting its own ladder now."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.331,
   "end": 114.429,
   "text": "Nadia is finishing a noncredit IT support certificate at North Orange Continuing Education."
  },
  {
   "start": 114.429,
   "end": 119.98,
   "text": "Her A plus certification from CompTIA already carries credit at twenty-one colleges,"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.98,
   "end": 123.888,
   "text": "and North Orange is building her path to an associate degree."
  },
  {
   "start": 127.188,
   "end": 129.174,
   "text": "Faculty have already said yes."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.174,
   "end": 130.842,
   "text": "At twenty-eight colleges,"
  },
  {
   "start": 130.842,
   "end": 135.052,
   "text": "seventy-eight percent of eligible EMT units reach a transcript,"
  },
  {
   "start": 135.052,
   "end": 141.644,
   "text": "and forty-nine statewide credit determinations sit ready at two hundred fifty-three college sites."
  },
  {
   "start": 141.644,
   "end": 144.185,
   "text": "Most of the opportunity is still ahead."
  },
  {
   "start": 145.985,
   "end": 152.561,
   "text": "The state budget provides thirty-five million dollars one-time and two million ongoing for CPL."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.561,
   "end": 157.638,
   "text": "Last year, fifty-thousand-dollar grants went to three noncredit programs."
  },
  {
   "start": 157.638,
   "end": 158.304,
   "text": "This year,"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.304,
   "end": 165.711,
   "text": "one point eight million dollars in noncredit funding reaches every community college noncredit program."
  },
  {
   "start": 165.711,
   "end": 169.623,
   "text": "Credit and noncredit FTES together size every max award."
  },
  {
   "start": 171.423,
   "end": 173.677,
   "text": "Three invitations to the field."
  },
  {
   "start": 173.677,
   "end": 174.803,
   "text": "Mirror a course."
  },
  {
   "start": 174.803,
   "end": 176.97,
   "text": "Post your certificates in MAP."
  },
  {
   "start": 176.97,
   "end": 179.05,
   "text": "Invite your completers back."
  },
  {
   "start": 179.05,
   "end": 182.69,
   "text": "The CPL Initiative team will help you with each one."
  },
  {
   "start": 182.69,
   "end": 183.73,
   "text": "Our time is now!"
  }
 ]
